        <li>
          <p>
            An exponential function <m>g(x) = b^{x}</m> such that <m>\dfrac{AROC_{[1,2]}}{AROC_{[0,1]}}> b</m>.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </p>
    </statement>
